1
00:00:02,769 --> 00:00:04,969
(Amy:)I just read about
an experiment designed

2
00:00:04,972 --> 00:00:06,272
(Amy:)to see if you could
make two people fall

3
00:00:06,273 --> 00:00:08,173
(Amy:)in love in a matter of hours.

4
00:00:08,175 --> 00:00:09,845
(Leonard:)That doesn't sound right.

5
00:00:09,844 --> 00:00:12,044
(Leonard:)My research has shown that
it takes three to five years

6
00:00:12,046 --> 00:00:14,716
(Leonard:)of shameless begging.

7
00:00:14,715 --> 00:00:17,685
(Penny:)Honey, neither of us comes off
good in that story.

8
00:00:17,685 --> 00:00:18,985
KOOTHRAPPALI:
Yeah, I-I...

9
00:00:18,986 --> 00:00:21,216
(Raj:)I saw that article
you're talking about.

10
00:00:21,222 --> 00:00:23,252
(Raj:)Uh, the participants
ask each other a series

11
00:00:23,257 --> 00:00:25,957
(Raj:)of questions designed
to promote intimacy.

12
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:27,290
(Amy:)And then they finish it off
by staring

13
00:00:27,294 --> 00:00:28,964
(Amy:)into each other's eyes
for four minutes.

14
00:00:28,963 --> 00:00:30,563
(Sheldon:)Oh, that's nonsense.

15
00:00:30,564 --> 00:00:32,694
(Sheldon:)I proclaimed my
love for you.

16
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:34,270
(Sheldon:)And the last time I
looked into your eyes

17
00:00:34,268 --> 00:00:37,238
(Sheldon:)was when you thought
you had conjunctivitis.

18
00:00:37,238 --> 00:00:39,468
(Amy:)Other than the fact
that I had it,

19
00:00:39,473 --> 00:00:41,173
(Amy:)that was a magical night.

20
00:00:42,476 --> 00:00:45,246
(Penny:)Raj, would you ever try an
experiment like that with Emily?

21
00:00:45,246 --> 00:00:47,516
(Raj:)What? I don't need
science to win her heart.

22
00:00:47,515 --> 00:00:50,345
(Raj:)I have my family's
wealth for that.

23
00:00:50,351 --> 00:00:52,781
(Leonard:)I'm telling you, you can't
create love in a few hours.

24
00:00:52,787 --> 00:00:54,557
(Leonard:)Right?
Oh, careful.

25
00:00:54,555 --> 00:00:57,255
(Penny:)You're poking at the whole
foundation of The Bachelor.

26
00:00:57,258 --> 00:00:58,588
SHELDON:
Yeah, but

27
00:00:58,592 --> 00:01:00,492
(Sheldon:)we don't have to debate this.

28
00:01:00,494 --> 00:01:01,824
(Sheldon:)We're scientists.

29
00:01:01,829 --> 00:01:03,959
(Sheldon:)We can conduct our own research.

30
00:01:03,964 --> 00:01:05,994
Yeah, I propose that we imprison

31
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,230
(Sheldon:)two street people.
No.

32
00:01:07,234 --> 00:01:09,734
(Amy:)And...

33
00:01:09,737 --> 00:01:11,167
(Sheldon:)You didn't even let me finish.

34
00:01:11,172 --> 00:01:13,102
Forget it!
Oh!

35
00:01:13,107 --> 00:01:15,407
(Sheldon:)So, you can experiment
on all the apes you want.

36
00:01:15,409 --> 00:01:17,979
(Sheldon:)But I want to manipulate
the emotions of two captive

37
00:01:17,978 --> 00:01:20,918
(Sheldon:)human beings, suddenly
I'm the monster.

38
00:01:20,915 --> 00:01:22,585
KOOTHRAPPALI:
Why don't you

39
00:01:22,583 --> 00:01:24,613
(Raj:)just do the test?

40
00:01:24,618 --> 00:01:27,758
(Sheldon:)In the interest of science,
I'd be willing to.

41
00:01:27,755 --> 00:01:29,385
(Penny:)What? You're okay with
an experiment where you have

42
00:01:29,390 --> 00:01:32,690
(Penny:)to answer awkward questions
about your innermost feelings?

43
00:01:32,693 --> 00:01:34,023
(Amy:)Yes.

44
00:01:34,028 --> 00:01:35,958
(Penny:)Please, can I do it
with him? Please?!

45
00:01:37,465 --> 00:01:39,735
(Leonard:)I've been listening
to Sheldon's feelings on things

46
00:01:39,733 --> 00:01:42,303
(Leonard:)for ten years.
Tag, you're it.

47
00:01:42,303 --> 00:01:45,003
(Raj:)Yeah, but what
if the experiment works?

48
00:01:45,005 --> 00:01:46,705
(Penny:)I'm not gonna fall
in love with Sheldon.

49
00:01:46,707 --> 00:01:47,807
AMY:
That's what I said.

50
00:01:47,808 --> 00:01:49,338
(Amy:)Before I knew it,
he pontificated his way

51
00:01:49,343 --> 00:01:51,473
(Amy:)right into my heart.

52
00:01:51,479 --> 00:01:54,149
(Sheldon:)Uh, fun fact--
"pontificate"

53
00:01:54,148 --> 00:01:56,318
(Sheldon:)comes from the Latin
word "pontifex,"

54
00:01:56,317 --> 00:01:58,387
which means "bridge
builder" or "Pope."

55
00:02:00,154 --> 00:02:04,044
(Leonard:)In love yet?

